  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186119807,
      "id": "92e5e826-3121-500a-9103-e618cb16c5b2",
      "title": "Solving for Two Coefficients in a Linear Combination"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "4b5bdf00-cac6-5dff-a3f1-4e5199fcc74f",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-8 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}-14 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}?$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-8 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}-14 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}3{x}_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ -2{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-8{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{2} \\\\ 4{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}-14 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}3{x}_{1}-8{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{2} \\\\ -2{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}-14 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}-8{x}_{2} &=-14 \\\\ -{x}_{2} &=-4 \\\\ -2{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2} &=4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the second equation we get ${x}_{2}=4$.\n\nSubstituting ${x}_{2}=4$ into the first equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}-8{x}_{2} &=-14 \\\\ 3{x}_{1}-8(4) &=-14 \\\\ 3{x}_{1} &=18 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute ${x}_{1}=6$ and ${x}_{2}=4$ into the third equation to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2} &=4 \\\\ -2(6)+4(4) &=4 \\\\ 4 &=4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a true statement.\n\nSo the solution of the system is ${x}_{1}=6$ and ${x}_{2}=4$, which means\n\n$$\n6{a}_{1}+4{a}_{2}=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently,\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=(6)+(4)=10.\n$$",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
