    "question": {
      ":question/id": "88795db3-92e7-5b48-8f45-62938dfb50ae",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}?$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}-{x}_{1} \\\\ -{x}_{1} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}-{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} &=6 \\\\ -{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} &=3 \\\\ {x}_{2} &=2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation we get ${x}_{2}=2$.\n\nSubstituting ${x}_{2}=2$ into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} &=3 \\\\ -{x}_{1}+(2) &=3 \\\\ -{x}_{1} &=1 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute ${x}_{1}=-1$ and ${x}_{2}=2$ into the first equation to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} &=6 \\\\ -(-1)+2(2) &=6 \\\\ 5 &=6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a false statement.\n\nSo, the system has no solution.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
